WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:06.850
<i>If I am to devote my life to someone,
I will surpass my limitation.</i>

00:00:07.070 --> 00:00:12.340
<i>Now and here,
I will become my own strength.</i>

00:00:12.350 --> 00:00:16.490
<i>And I will march toward the future.</i>

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:25.600
<i>There are places I like to forget.
There are memories I like to forget.</i>

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:31.950
<i>I can't get rid of this swirling hesitation...
and my pride is wounded.</i>

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:38.080
<i>The light is covered in dust,
if you see through the darkness...</i>

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:44.500
<i>You can find your path to the new door.</i>

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:50.730
<i>Beautiful sword dances like the wind.</i>

00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:57.650
<i>Fate so strong, it creates miracles in my life.</i>

00:00:57.670 --> 00:01:00.220
<i>Flower of Bravery.</i>

00:01:00.220 --> 00:01:07.100
<i>Looking only for the truth.
I noticed you were there beside me.</i>

00:01:07.140 --> 00:01:12.820
<i>Your special soul will be our bond.</i>

00:01:12.980 --> 00:01:19.550
<i>A sadness I can't break free reflects in the depths of my memory.</i>

00:01:19.710 --> 00:01:24.850
<i>Now and here, my sadness will be my strength.</i>

00:01:24.930 --> 00:01:27.520
<i>And I will march toward the future.</i>

00:02:00.860 --> 00:02:04.960
Hey Sei, are you still mad about that?

00:02:05.070 --> 00:02:08.510
I'm just in a bad mood.

00:02:08.720 --> 00:02:11.220
Then you are mad.

00:02:11.640 --> 00:02:16.400
I already apologized for eating the menma while you were in the bathroom.  I'm sorry.

00:02:17.900 --> 00:02:22.400
Since you left it untouched, I thought you didn't want it.

00:02:22.660 --> 00:02:23.850
- Right?
- Right!

00:02:23.980 --> 00:02:25.060
It wasn't because of that.

00:02:26.070 --> 00:02:31.390
I saved it for last because it's my favorite.

00:02:33.470 --> 00:02:35.940
<i>That was delicious.</i>

00:02:36.120 --> 00:02:38.720
<i>Thanks for the meal!</i>

00:02:38.790 --> 00:02:39.660
<i>Huh?</i>

00:02:40.150 --> 00:02:42.130
<i>Sei has leftover menma.</i>

00:02:42.440 --> 00:02:45.500
<i>What a waste, the menma here is delicious.</i>

00:02:45.610 --> 00:02:47.450
<i>Then I'm going to eat it!</i>

00:02:47.690 --> 00:02:48.880
<i>Me too!</i>

00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:53.570
<i>Ah, it was delicious!</i>

00:03:04.070 --> 00:03:05.220
Menma...

00:03:06.680 --> 00:03:09.360
Rin Rin, this is happening because you were greedy.

00:03:09.430 --> 00:03:11.170
You ate them too.

00:03:11.270 --> 00:03:12.590
I said that was...

00:03:14.640 --> 00:03:20.660
When we get to the next village, let's have Ramen again.  I'll give you all of my menmas!

00:03:20.760 --> 00:03:22.360
You can have mine too.

00:03:23.270 --> 00:03:25.590
People and menma are like once in a lifetime meetings...

00:03:26.190 --> 00:03:30.500
No matter what we do, the lost menma can't be replaced!

00:03:34.010 --> 00:03:39.020
<b>Chohi Competes with Koumei</b>

00:03:41.380 --> 00:03:45.480
The road turns into a fork.  I wonder which way we should take.

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:50.940
Don’t worry; I’ll take care of this.

00:04:01.690 --> 00:04:03.040
We go that way!

00:04:03.220 --> 00:04:06.380
All right, let’s go that way.

00:04:22.720 --> 00:04:23.800
Menma…

00:04:30.720 --> 00:04:32.220
It’s getting foggy.

00:04:32.320 --> 00:04:34.270
It’s getting denser.

00:04:34.440 --> 00:04:36.880
There’s no end to it.

00:04:37.400 --> 00:04:38.250
Just kidding!

00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:47.410
This is bad.  We won’t know if we stray from our path.  Rin Rin, wait!

00:04:47.580 --> 00:04:49.390
Don’t run off like that.

00:04:49.740 --> 00:04:51.200
What happened to Sei?

00:04:51.200 --> 00:04:51.860
What?

00:04:52.350 --> 00:04:56.830
Sei, Sei are you here?  Where are you?

00:04:57.390 --> 00:05:01.010
Sei, please stop being mad and answer me.

00:05:02.330 --> 00:05:05.210
Oh no, it seems like we’ve lost her.

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:06.010
Let’s look for her!

00:05:07.440 --> 00:05:09.520
Hey, Sei!

00:05:09.630 --> 00:05:11.370
Where are you?

00:05:11.440 --> 00:05:13.570
If you can hear me, please answer!

00:05:14.040 --> 00:05:15.870
Sei, where are……

00:05:16.690 --> 00:05:17.350
Aisha!

00:05:17.940 --> 00:05:20.860
Rin Rin, watch your step!  There’s a slope here.

00:05:22.530 --> 00:05:24.650
Aisha, are you okay?

00:05:24.820 --> 00:05:26.110
I am fine…

00:05:26.390 --> 00:05:27.190
What’s the matter?

00:05:28.370 --> 00:05:30.000
It looks like I sprained my ankle.

00:05:30.070 --> 00:05:32.270
Oh no, what should we do?

00:05:32.400 --> 00:05:39.080
There is really nothing we can do in this fog.  I'd rather stay put than be walking around without a clue.

00:05:41.510 --> 00:05:42.630
Menma…

00:05:43.040 --> 00:05:44.330
Huh?

00:05:53.650 --> 00:05:58.620
It’s getting clear.  I see a house over there!

00:05:59.280 --> 00:06:02.860
Thank goodness.  Maybe we can ask them to let us rest for a while.

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:05.440
I’ll carry you on my back.

00:06:05.650 --> 00:06:06.480
I am sorry…

00:06:06.550 --> 00:06:08.910
Don’t worry about it.

00:06:09.020 --> 00:06:12.840
Those bouncy breasts feel nice on my back.

00:06:14.200 --> 00:06:16.670
Hey, don’t move around like that!

00:06:19.280 --> 00:06:22.580
Hello, excuse me?

00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:24.530
Yes?

00:06:30.850 --> 00:06:34.500
Big trouble master!  Master Suikyou!

00:06:34.680 --> 00:06:37.950
What happened Shuri, why the panic?!

00:06:38.290 --> 00:06:41.950
There are travelers at the gate and one of them is injured.

00:06:42.190 --> 00:06:44.210
Oh, that is bad.

00:06:45.530 --> 00:06:52.340
I see.  That was unfortunate.  We often get a sudden dense fog around here.

00:06:54.880 --> 00:06:56.270
This should take care of it.

00:06:57.070 --> 00:07:03.780
You should stay here until your ankle heals.  And your lost companion might be found in the meantime.

00:07:04.720 --> 00:07:05.520
I am very thankful to you.

00:07:07.190 --> 00:07:11.990
My name is Shibaki Suikyou.  And…

00:07:12.440 --> 00:07:15.990
I am Shokatsuryou Koumei.

00:07:16.400 --> 00:07:18.770
Shuri, wrap a bandage around the ankle please.

00:07:18.840 --> 00:07:20.090
Yes, master.

00:07:25.310 --> 00:07:26.630
I am so sorry to trouble you.

00:07:27.180 --> 00:07:28.300
Oh, it’s nothing.

00:07:31.220 --> 00:07:32.780
Phew!  It’s finished.

00:07:33.370 --> 00:07:36.540
Nicely done.

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:41.130
I have practiced hard to become as good as you are.

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:43.000
I see.  That’s very commendable.

00:07:47.350 --> 00:07:52.700
Suikyou, I am thankful for the treatments, please do not go out of your way…

00:07:52.810 --> 00:07:57.950
It is nothing.  Consider yourself lucky that you don’t have a broken bone.

00:07:58.130 --> 00:07:59.690
You have to make sure not to move your leg.

00:07:59.970 --> 00:08:03.140
So… I can’t even go to the bathroom.

00:08:03.590 --> 00:08:08.420
No problem.   If you need to pee, I’ll carry you to the bathroom.

00:08:08.490 --> 00:08:12.280
You don’t have to bother.  You can use this.

00:08:13.640 --> 00:08:16.700
If you have to go, please don’t hesitate to ask.

00:08:17.110 --> 00:08:19.410
Uhh, that’s a bit much!

00:08:26.570 --> 00:08:29.600
Wow, this looks delicious.

00:08:30.080 --> 00:08:32.860
Shuri made tonight’s dinner.

00:08:33.040 --> 00:08:36.340
Wow, Koumei, you even can cook.

00:08:36.410 --> 00:08:38.570
I hope you like it.

00:08:38.670 --> 00:08:40.860
Now let’s eat.

00:08:41.450 --> 00:08:43.050
Thanks for the food.

00:08:47.050 --> 00:08:48.340
This is great!

00:08:48.440 --> 00:08:49.550
Yummy!

00:08:49.900 --> 00:08:51.220
I am glad to hear it.

00:08:51.540 --> 00:08:57.970
It is a great accomplishment to make such a great meal at your age.  Compared to that, Rin Rin can only eat.

00:08:58.980 --> 00:09:01.200
I can cook too.

00:09:01.340 --> 00:09:03.740
Really, what can you make?

00:09:05.690 --> 00:09:08.610
Things like Onigiri and Omusubi.

00:09:12.850 --> 00:09:16.710
What’s so funny?

00:09:24.220 --> 00:09:27.180
I hope Sei’s okay.

00:09:30.310 --> 00:09:32.980
It’s nice to take a bath after such a long time.

00:09:33.400 --> 00:09:37.430
Hey, don’t wander around half naked.  You’ll catch a cold.

00:09:37.820 --> 00:09:40.220
Kan'u, I will give you a sponge bath.

00:09:41.150 --> 00:09:43.660
I am sorry to trouble you with every little thing.

00:09:44.040 --> 00:09:49.150
Don’t worry.  We have to help each other in the time of need.  Please undress.

00:09:49.260 --> 00:09:53.640
But before that…

00:09:54.090 --> 00:09:57.640
How should I put this, a normal bodily function, or something like that…

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:01.150
Oh, you mean this.

00:10:01.460 --> 00:10:04.800
You are too kind, but that’s a bit…

00:10:04.900 --> 00:10:07.300
Could it be number two?

00:10:07.340 --> 00:10:11.090
That is not what I meant.  Rin Rin!

00:10:12.270 --> 00:10:14.050
Coming!

00:10:14.850 --> 00:10:16.100
I’ll leave it to you.

00:10:16.240 --> 00:10:17.280
You can depend on me.

00:10:17.660 --> 00:10:19.650
Oh, if that is the case.

00:10:23.540 --> 00:10:25.110
Wow, this is great.

00:10:25.210 --> 00:10:29.350
I made it.  So, people who have leg injuries can move around.

00:10:29.800 --> 00:10:31.090
This is very useful.

00:10:35.430 --> 00:10:41.970
Master says, "Happiness is acquiring knowledge and putting it to use."

00:10:42.840 --> 00:10:47.460
"An old friend coming for a visit is also happiness."

00:10:47.780 --> 00:10:51.700
"A great person should not be concerned by others' praise."

00:10:52.850 --> 00:10:57.020
Master says, "If a person has personality and devotion, they…"

00:10:57.060 --> 00:11:03.460
Suikyou, Koumei is a great kid!  Honest, intelligent and loves to study.

00:11:03.690 --> 00:11:05.820
Plus, she’s very helpful around the house.

00:11:05.960 --> 00:11:08.600
Isn’t Rin Rin also a good kid?

00:11:08.710 --> 00:11:10.900
Oh, she is not at all!

00:11:10.970 --> 00:11:14.130
She is outgoing and bright.  I like her very much.

00:11:15.040 --> 00:11:17.960
And she always thinks of her mother.

00:11:18.480 --> 00:11:20.040
Huh?  Mother?

00:11:20.560 --> 00:11:22.230
Oh, you are not?

00:11:22.510 --> 00:11:26.790
We are not mother and daughter!  But sisters, we took a vow of sisterhood.

00:11:26.860 --> 00:11:30.540
Why is there always the assumption?  First of all, I haven’t done anything that will get me pregnant.

00:11:30.580 --> 00:11:34.190
I understand, calm down.

00:11:36.590 --> 00:11:44.970
She lost her parents when she was very young.

00:11:45.320 --> 00:11:48.140
She was separated from her sisters while being passed from relatives to relatives.

00:11:48.450 --> 00:11:56.480
She settled with my master for a while, later I took her in.

00:11:56.620 --> 00:11:58.080
I see.

00:11:59.230 --> 00:12:03.300
As you mentioned, she is a very good child.

00:12:03.580 --> 00:12:10.670
Since moving in with me, she has never made an unreasonable or a selfish request.

00:12:10.810 --> 00:12:19.640
Sometimes I feel she has developed a sad personality, because of her hardships.

00:12:19.920 --> 00:12:21.270
Suikyou.

00:12:22.180 --> 00:12:24.820
"…then learn from the text."

00:12:28.300 --> 00:12:33.060
The medicine Suikyou made works well.

00:12:33.310 --> 00:12:40.290
Yes.  When she is asked, we deliver them to the villagers living below.

00:12:40.850 --> 00:12:45.750
I'd like to become just like my master, helping people in need.

00:12:46.140 --> 00:12:50.730
To achieve this goal, I have to study very hard.

00:12:50.830 --> 00:12:54.310
I see.  Koumei, you really are a very good kid.

00:12:55.450 --> 00:12:59.700
I am sorry.  I saw Suikyou doing that, so subconsciously…

00:13:00.080 --> 00:13:04.150
That is all right.  I like being petted.

00:13:15.550 --> 00:13:19.970
It has been three days since we applied the medicine, but the swelling hasn’t healed yet.

00:13:20.590 --> 00:13:23.830
It would be nice to have Salonpas-grass in a time like this.

00:13:24.000 --> 00:13:26.330
What is a Salonpas-grass?

00:13:26.540 --> 00:13:29.430
It is an herb that works well on swellings like this.

00:13:29.630 --> 00:13:34.080
It is a grass with small white flowers, the leaves are grinded and used for medicine.

00:13:34.990 --> 00:13:38.010
Master I will go and get some.

00:13:38.400 --> 00:13:43.230
They only grow in the high elevation of the mountain.

00:13:43.400 --> 00:13:48.620
I remember where they grow, from the few times I went with you.

00:13:48.690 --> 00:13:53.490
It will be better if I go with you.

00:13:53.830 --> 00:13:58.600
But I have to deliver the medicine requested by the villagers.

00:14:00.680 --> 00:14:02.700
Then I guess I have to ask you.

00:14:04.130 --> 00:14:05.100
Yes, master.

00:14:06.870 --> 00:14:08.370
Okay.

00:14:08.990 --> 00:14:10.870
I am ready to go.

00:14:12.160 --> 00:14:14.800
Be careful not to fall.

00:14:15.430 --> 00:14:16.710
I will.

00:14:20.260 --> 00:14:27.940
Master says, "Happiness is acquiring knowledge and putting it to use.  An old friend coming for a visit is also happiness."

00:14:27.980 --> 00:14:30.380
I won’t let her succeed at this.

00:14:31.320 --> 00:14:33.580
I’ll follow her.

00:14:34.340 --> 00:14:38.030
And steal the herb as soon as she picks it!

00:14:38.830 --> 00:14:42.410
No, that is not how it’s going to happen.  When we get to where it grows...

00:14:42.440 --> 00:14:47.240
I’ll pick them as well, and return before she does.  And then I’ll give them to Aisha.

00:14:48.220 --> 00:14:51.170
<i>Look, these are the salonpas-grass.</i>

00:14:51.210 --> 00:14:54.930
<i>Well done Rin Rin, just as I expected from my sister.</i>

00:15:01.010 --> 00:15:04.250
<i>Boy, is she clumsy.  Tripping on everything.</i>

00:15:05.110 --> 00:15:11.030
I can definitely out run her, after we pick the herbs.

00:15:35.780 --> 00:15:38.150
<i>Why is she hesitating?</i>

00:15:38.430 --> 00:15:45.100
<i>She is afraid of heights!  She must be scared and can’t cross the suspension bridge.</i>

00:15:45.830 --> 00:15:50.560
When my master was here, she held my hand and we crossed together.

00:15:51.080 --> 00:15:54.590
I have to be brave for Kan'u.

00:16:03.530 --> 00:16:05.090
I have to be brave.

00:16:12.650 --> 00:16:15.310
I’m not scared… I’m not scared.

00:16:27.310 --> 00:16:29.990
<i>Geez, how long will it take her to cross the bridge?</i>

00:16:39.870 --> 00:16:44.700
Finally, I made it.  If I remember correctly, it should be around here.

00:16:44.770 --> 00:16:46.960
Ah, there.

00:16:48.210 --> 00:16:48.910
But…

00:16:53.840 --> 00:16:57.770
<i>She’ll never get that high because of her fear of heights.</i>

00:16:58.500 --> 00:17:02.570
<i>I’ll pick it and take it back after she gives up and leaves.</i>

00:17:15.540 --> 00:17:18.910
She’ll be scared halfway and give up.

00:17:27.190 --> 00:17:28.680
Oh no!

00:17:34.560 --> 00:17:39.320
<i>Why is it?  That she keeps going on?</i>

00:17:39.840 --> 00:17:44.090
<i>Why is she so desperately trying?  Even though she’s afraid of heights.</i>

00:17:46.040 --> 00:17:48.580
Just a little bit further.

00:18:11.140 --> 00:18:12.080
Chōhi?

00:18:12.690 --> 00:18:13.260
Here you go.

00:18:13.800 --> 00:18:15.130
Why did you come here?

00:18:15.300 --> 00:18:19.260
Why…?  By chance, it’s just a coincidence.

00:18:19.760 --> 00:18:21.450
This deep in the mountain?

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:23.400
Could you have been following me?

00:18:23.420 --> 00:18:26.340
That doesn’t matter; we have to pick the salonpas-grass.

00:18:26.480 --> 00:18:27.930
Oh, yes.

00:18:47.080 --> 00:18:48.710
You did it!

00:18:52.350 --> 00:18:53.350
Take it.

00:18:53.750 --> 00:18:56.340
But Chōhi, it’s yours.

00:18:56.360 --> 00:19:00.400
You’re the one who found it.  I only helped a bit.

00:19:00.780 --> 00:19:02.490
So you give it to Aisha.

00:19:06.340 --> 00:19:07.380
Chōhi…

00:19:26.900 --> 00:19:30.370
We’ll cross together, give me your hand.

00:19:52.840 --> 00:19:54.670
You’re kind.

00:19:54.720 --> 00:19:56.920
What are you talking about!

00:19:57.900 --> 00:20:00.460
You were afraid so I had no choice, but to help you.

00:20:00.940 --> 00:20:03.740
I’m not kind at all!

00:20:03.790 --> 00:20:05.050
Um, Chōhi…

00:20:05.500 --> 00:20:09.510
Can I call you Rin Rin?

00:20:13.620 --> 00:20:16.610
I don’t mind if you want.

00:20:16.660 --> 00:20:20.480
But I am not going to call you Shuri.

00:20:20.700 --> 00:20:23.170
If that’s fine, then do as you wish.

00:20:24.240 --> 00:20:26.070
Yes, Rin Rin.

00:20:26.710 --> 00:20:30.390
Welcome back, oh my, you got all dirty.

00:20:31.150 --> 00:20:32.530
Here master, take this.

00:20:32.570 --> 00:20:34.530
Well done.

00:20:34.530 --> 00:20:36.530
Did you get it all by yourself?

00:20:36.730 --> 00:20:38.420
No, not by myself…

00:20:39.530 --> 00:20:42.620
I did it with Rin Rin.

00:21:02.660 --> 00:21:05.130
Oh?  The swelling has gone away completely.

00:21:05.610 --> 00:21:07.790
It seems the Salonpas-grass was what you needed.

00:21:08.010 --> 00:21:08.960
That means…

00:21:09.150 --> 00:21:11.400
Yes, you are ready to walk.

00:21:11.480 --> 00:21:16.150
I have caused you so much trouble, how can I ever thank you?

00:21:16.510 --> 00:21:20.140
We all should help each other in times of need.

00:21:20.190 --> 00:21:25.920
There is no need for you to thank me.  I won’t take “no” for an answer.  Is there anything I can do for you?

00:21:27.600 --> 00:21:31.190
Then, I have one favor to ask you.

00:21:31.450 --> 00:21:31.880
Yes.

00:21:32.230 --> 00:21:38.340
I will be imposing on you, but would you take Shuri on your journey?

00:21:39.550 --> 00:21:41.040
Take Koumei on our journey?

00:21:41.470 --> 00:21:48.260
Yes.  She has expressed interest in taking a journey and seeing the world.

00:21:48.980 --> 00:21:54.960
When I was young, I too, took a journey and gained many great experiences.

00:21:55.440 --> 00:22:00.000
I want her to find her path.

00:22:00.880 --> 00:22:08.740
As you know these are dangerous times.  Even at her level of maturity, she is still too young.

00:22:09.380 --> 00:22:15.010
So if it is all right, I would like you to take her on your journey.

00:22:15.390 --> 00:22:17.810
That I don’t mind.

00:22:18.020 --> 00:22:20.520
Will you be all right?

00:22:21.040 --> 00:22:23.630
Oh, you have a point.

00:22:23.870 --> 00:22:27.480
I will be quite lonely without her here.

00:22:28.760 --> 00:22:34.670
To go on a journey has been her only request.

00:22:35.080 --> 00:22:38.710
I want to grant her wish.

00:22:41.560 --> 00:22:46.880
I will personally look after Shokatsuryou Koumei.

00:22:51.230 --> 00:22:53.770
Master Suikyou, please take care!

00:22:53.840 --> 00:22:55.810
She won’t hear you from here.

00:22:55.880 --> 00:22:59.040
But I won’t be able to see her for a long time.

00:22:59.370 --> 00:23:01.560
Then you shouldn’t go on a journey.

00:23:03.500 --> 00:23:06.760
